<title>UK: Price Waterhouse in Russia joint venture.</title>
<headline>Price Waterhouse in Russia joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Management consultancy Price Waterhouse has formed a joint venture with Russian information technology company LVS.</p>
<p>&quot;The combined business will create the largest management consulting organisation in Russia and the former Soviet Union with over 300 consulting professionals,&quot; Price Waterhouse said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Price Waterhouse, which has a turnover of $1.2 billion a year, said that it and LVS, a $16 million business, would provide management services and information technology to businesses in the region.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom 44 171 542 5887</p>
</text>
